INSERT INTO `khayah_posts` VALUES("3830", "1", "2021-09-08 17:46:03", "2021-09-08 08:46:03", "<p id=\"SE-1e7300f3-f924-4d81-8f2d-51b8789bb5ff\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><br />안녕하세요. 카야 인터내셔널입니다. &#x1f60a;<br /></span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><br />카야의 주요 해외 사업지인 미얀마는<br /></span><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">\'쿠데타\'와 \'코로나19\'로 여전히 힘겨운 시간을 보내고 있습니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">그 속에서도 \'양공 더공세이컨 69약궤\' 빈민마을은<br /></span><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">당장 먹을 것이 없고, 일자리가 사라지며  실업률은 90%까지 치솟았습니다.<br />그야말로 매일매일이 위태롭기만 합니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">카야 인터내셔널은 홀로 생계를 책임지는 빈민마을 여성들과<br />코로나19로 1년 반째 학교 수업을 들을 수 없는 아동들을 위한<br /></span><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">\'토닥토닥\' 추석 양말 선물세트 펀딩을 준비했습니다.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3 id=\"SE-0bcd97c2-be3d-49bc-9ac1-222aed45ec90\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"><span id=\"SE-5d098a24-8340-49bf-b33a-feb06908668c\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">더욱 많은 사람들과 함께 </span><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">더욱 큰 힘으로<br /></span></span><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"></span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\">미얀마 빈민 여성과 아이들을 위한<br /></span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\">\'토닥토닥\' 추석 양말 선물세트로</span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SE-a91b6a22-77b9-44a8-9759-fbac1eee6e03\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x1f389;</b></span><span id=\"SE-8335482b-781f-431a-b8ae-09cd39175fe3\" class=\"se-fs-fs28 se-ff-   \" style=\"color: #4cb327;\"><i><span style=\"color: #80c72d;\"><strong>오마이컴퍼니</strong></span><b><span style=\"color: #80c72d;\"> 펀딩</span> </b></i></span><span id=\"SE-a088eae5-250e-444a-af65-44b96a126a0e\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"><b>을 </b></span><span id=\"SE-0a5ed8c4-776c-4ad9-ba5f-253ad3c1dd24\" class=\"se-fs-fs28 se-ff-   \" style=\"color: #3556b8;\"><i><b>오픈 </b></i></span><span id=\"SE-d6990531-beb7-466d-abc3-f705f28ad961\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><b><span style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\">했습니다.!!</span>&#x1f389;<br /><br /></b></span></h3>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-3823\" src=\"http://khayah.org/khayah/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/001.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>&#x2705; OPEN: 2021년 9월 6일 (월)<br />&#x2705; CLOSE: 201년 9월 30일 (목)</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>다가오는 추석 고마운 맘을 &#x1f381;고급 양말 선물세트&#x1f381;로 전해보세요.<br />주변에 나눌수록 기쁨이 배가 됩니다.&#x2764;&#xfe0f;<br />더 많은 사람이 함께할 수 있도록 많이많이 소문내주세요.&#x1f64c;<br />펀딩 참여 이벤트도 진행 중이니 많은 참여부탁드립니다.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p id=\"SE-f44cc857-dfe8-42a3-95c7-534bbdb653e7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-82c83f33-20b4-497f-ab24-b6d8ca6dfc42\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">리워드의 제작 및 운영비를 제외한 </span><span id=\"SE-b2ace004-96e9-4166-9f4a-335cd2dbf3aa\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2757;&#xfe0f;</b></span><span id=\"SE-6fe52b54-b599-48f2-8104-20e90bd8639b\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">펀딩 수익금 전액</span><span id=\"SE-6df808ce-59b8-45bb-a323-034d36ddcdd5\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2757;&#xfe0f;</b></span><span id=\"SE-1eb0e918-c444-473d-b137-80dc58e6feb9\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">은<br /></span><span id=\"SE-12bb8cf1-facb-4c15-a674-994b73624fef\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>\'카야 미얀마\'를 통해</b></span><span id=\"SE-a63ee2fd-a7a1-47be-b191-ce1532296406\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"> 양곤 더공세이컨 69약궤<br /></span><span id=\"SE-af248873-6132-4006-88b6-abc81e524a6b\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>빈민 여성</b></span><span id=\"SE-50ca5772-3bd0-4b51-b06e-65db21201109\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">들의 안정적인 일자리와 생계를 위한 </span><span id=\"SE-ceef38c4-e099-40cc-9331-7282d6102f6a\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><u><b>\'소규모 봉제공장 설립\'</b></u></span><span id=\"SE-23af15f2-a30f-40a3-8c52-3f1a83d9f9f4\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">과<br /></span><span id=\"SE-26b86b5f-2e01-41d9-b92a-45bb39fd00c8\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>마을 아이</b></span><span id=\"SE-a101d140-3825-4b58-9d7f-ba23a1959a7b\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">들을 위한 </span><span id=\"SE-27eda8c1-8558-4745-9a57-75de183ae2c7\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><u><b>\'도서&amp;놀이키트\'</b></u></span><span id=\"SE-c53c6e5c-762d-46b6-af9d-12a73118807c\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"> 지원에 사용될 예정입니다.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&#x1f53d; 지금바로 참여하기 &#x1f53d;</strong><br /><a href=\"https://www.ohmycompany.com/reward/11197\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>https://www.ohmycompany.com/reward/11197</strong></a></h3>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-c6667528-a8a1-4da0-8ed6-79328b60732d\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">카야가 준비한 양말은 쉽게 접할 수 없는 남다름을 가졌습니다. <br /></span><span id=\"SE-91676a96-7a71-4dd4-a4d2-47ba0946526f\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">허투루 만들지 않은 \'컬러앤컴포트\'의 양말 직접 신어보세요 !!<br /></span>.<br />.</p>\n<p id=\"SE-a532e4c9-6d81-481f-9d29-b90c8a9d174f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-8e14e80b-b455-4f99-8789-7891f04c1a2a\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>[싹~다 있는 남다른 양말]<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-6ab41413-ef7b-47b3-be09-43dc5eaf9693\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;세균, 땀 냄새 제거하는 효성 에어로실버 기능 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-5a733ee6-9b4a-44cb-b432-951a76a29f38\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;30수 코마 면사, 200침 고밀도 쫀쫀짜임 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-a32e861e-9926-4629-8e62-f9d58318bf79\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;직접 개발한 감각적인 디자인 &amp; 감성적인 색감 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-dd583e07-1e84-4db8-a0ac-898a6b59077a\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f; BCI 인증실 사용, ZERO WASTE로 친환경 잇다!<br /></b></span><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f; ‘수익금 전액’ 기부로 사람과 세상을 잇다!</b><span id=\"SE-aa0102b7-784b-4341-b6cb-969265858938\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><b>​</b></span></p>\n<p id=\"SE-070bed32-e488-419c-8cb5-1876415eb78a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-5f7c15ba-8615-4d37-a082-1f13034bb6eb\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;2.5cm의 흘러내림 없는 무압박 발목밴드 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-cf1576fb-7c9a-4d51-af1c-605dfa50d6fd\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;절대 안벗겨지는 4줄 와이파이 논슬립 잇다!</b></span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><br />.<br />.<br />_<br /><a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/savemyanmar/\">#Savemyanmar</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%AF%B8%EC%95%BC%EB%A7%88/\">#미야마</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%B9%88%EB%AF%BC%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%84/\">#빈민마을</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%AF%B8%EC%96%80%EB%A7%88%EC%BF%A0%EB%8D%B0%ED%83%80/\">#미얀마쿠데타</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%BD%94%EB%A1%9C%EB%82%9819/\">#코로나19</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%81%AC%EB%9D%BC%EC%9A%B0%EB%93%9C%ED%8E%80%EB%94%A9/\">#크라우드펀딩</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8E%80%EB%94%A9%EC%98%A4%ED%94%88/\">#펀딩오픈</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8E%80%EB%94%A9%EC%B0%B8%EC%97%AC%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8/\">#펀딩참여이벤트</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%AF%B8%EC%96%80%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%98%EB%B4%84/\">#미얀마의봄</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8C%A8%EC%85%98%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#패션양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%97%AC%EB%A6%84%EB%8D%A7%EC%8B%A0/\">#여름덧신</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%ED%81%AC%EC%82%AD%EC%8A%A4/\">#페이크삭스</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%85%BC%EC%8A%AC%EB%A6%BD%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#논슬립양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%95%88%EB%B2%97%EA%B2%A8%EC%A7%80%EB%8A%94/\">#안벗겨지는</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%95%80%ED%9D%A1%EC%88%98%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#땀흡수양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EA%B8%B0%EB%8A%A5%EC%84%B1%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#기능성양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B9%9C%ED%99%98%EA%B2%BD%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#친환경양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EA%B8%B0%EB%B6%80%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#기부양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%88%98%EC%9D%B5%EA%B8%88%EC%A0%84%EC%95%A1%EA%B8%B0%EB%B6%80/\">#수익금전액기부</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B0%A9%ED%95%9C%EC%86%8C%EB%B9%84/\">#착한소비</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B6%94%EC%84%9D%EC%84%A0%EB%AC%BC%EC%84%B8%ED%8A%B8/\">#추석선물세트</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B6%94%EC%84%9D%EC%84%A0%EB%AC%BC%EC%B6%94%EC%B2%9C/\">#추석선물추천</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90%EC%84%A0%EB%AC%BC/\">#양말선물</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90%EC%84%B8%ED%8A%B8/\">#양말세트</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%84%A0%EB%AC%BC%EC%9A%A9%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#선물용양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%8B%B9%EB%8B%A4%EC%9E%88%EB%8A%94/\">#싹다있는</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%82%AD%EC%8A%A4%EC%9E%87%EB%8B%A4/\">#삭스잇다</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%98%A4%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%B4%EC%BB%B4%ED%8D%BC%EB%8B%88/\">#오마이컴퍼니</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B9%B4%EC%95%BC%EC%9D%B8%ED%84%B0%EB%82%B4%EC%85%94%EB%84%90/\">#카야인터내셔널</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%BB%AC%EB%9F%AC%EC%95%A4%EC%BB%B4%ED%8F%AC%ED%8A%B8/\">#컬러앤컴포트</a></p>\n<div class=\"autosourcing-stub-extra\"> </div>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[hr height=\"20\" style=\"default\" line=\"default\" themecolor=\"0\"]<br /><!-- // --></p>\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->", "미얀마 빈민 여성들과 아이들을 위한 \'토닥토닥\' 추석 양말 선물세트 펀딩 오픈", "", "inherit", "closed", "closed", "", "3821-revision-v1", "", "", "2021-09-08 17:46:03", "2021-09-08 08:46:03", "", "3821", "http://khayah.org/khayah/3821-revision-v1/", "0", "revision", "", "0");
INSERT INTO `khayah_posts` VALUES("3829", "1", "2021-09-08 17:45:16", "2021-09-08 08:45:16", "<p id=\"SE-1e7300f3-f924-4d81-8f2d-51b8789bb5ff\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><br />안녕하세요. 카야 인터내셔널입니다. &#x1f60a;<br /></span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><br />카야의 주요 해외 사업지인 미얀마는<br /></span><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">\'쿠데타\'와 \'코로나19\'로 여전히 힘겨운 시간을 보내고 있습니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">그 속에서도 \'양공 더공세이컨 69약궤\' 빈민마을은<br /></span><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">당장 먹을 것이 없고, 일자리가 사라지며  실업률은 90%까지 치솟았습니다.<br />그야말로 매일매일이 위태롭기만 합니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">카야 인터내셔널은 홀로 생계를 책임지는 빈민마을 여성들과<br />코로나19로 1년 반째 학교 수업을 들을 수 없는 아동들을 위한<br /></span><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">\'토닥토닥\' 추석 양말 선물세트 펀딩을 준비했습니다.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3 id=\"SE-0bcd97c2-be3d-49bc-9ac1-222aed45ec90\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"><span id=\"SE-5d098a24-8340-49bf-b33a-feb06908668c\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">더욱 많은 사람들과 함께 </span><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">더욱 큰 힘으로<br /></span></span><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"></span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\">미얀마 빈민 여성과 아이들을 위한<br /></span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\">\'토닥토닥\' 추석 양말 선물세트로</span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"><br /></span><span id=\"SE-a91b6a22-77b9-44a8-9759-fbac1eee6e03\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x1f389;</b></span><span id=\"SE-8335482b-781f-431a-b8ae-09cd39175fe3\" class=\"se-fs-fs28 se-ff-   \" style=\"color: #4cb327;\"><i><span style=\"color: #80c72d;\"><strong>오마이컴퍼니</strong></span><b><span style=\"color: #80c72d;\"> 펀딩</span> </b></i></span><span id=\"SE-a088eae5-250e-444a-af65-44b96a126a0e\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"><b>을 </b></span><span id=\"SE-0a5ed8c4-776c-4ad9-ba5f-253ad3c1dd24\" class=\"se-fs-fs28 se-ff-   \" style=\"color: #3556b8;\"><i><b>오픈 </b></i></span><span id=\"SE-d6990531-beb7-466d-abc3-f705f28ad961\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><b><span style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\">했습니다.!!</span>&#x1f389;</b></span></h3>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-3823\" src=\"http://khayah.org/khayah/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/001.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>&#x2705; OPEN: 2021년 9월 6일 (월)<br />&#x2705; CLOSE: 201년 9월 30일 (목)</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>다가오는 추석 고마운 맘을 &#x1f381;고급 양말 선물세트&#x1f381;로 전해보세요.<br />주변에 나눌수록 기쁨이 배가 됩니다.&#x2764;&#xfe0f;<br />더 많은 사람이 함께할 수 있도록 많이많이 소문내주세요.&#x1f64c;<br />펀딩 참여 이벤트도 진행 중이니 많은 참여부탁드립니다.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p id=\"SE-f44cc857-dfe8-42a3-95c7-534bbdb653e7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-82c83f33-20b4-497f-ab24-b6d8ca6dfc42\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">리워드의 제작 및 운영비를 제외한 </span><span id=\"SE-b2ace004-96e9-4166-9f4a-335cd2dbf3aa\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2757;&#xfe0f;</b></span><span id=\"SE-6fe52b54-b599-48f2-8104-20e90bd8639b\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">펀딩 수익금 전액</span><span id=\"SE-6df808ce-59b8-45bb-a323-034d36ddcdd5\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2757;&#xfe0f;</b></span><span id=\"SE-1eb0e918-c444-473d-b137-80dc58e6feb9\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">은<br /></span><span id=\"SE-12bb8cf1-facb-4c15-a674-994b73624fef\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>\'카야 미얀마\'를 통해</b></span><span id=\"SE-a63ee2fd-a7a1-47be-b191-ce1532296406\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"> 양곤 더공세이컨 69약궤<br /></span><span id=\"SE-af248873-6132-4006-88b6-abc81e524a6b\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>빈민 여성</b></span><span id=\"SE-50ca5772-3bd0-4b51-b06e-65db21201109\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">들의 안정적인 일자리와 생계를 위한 </span><span id=\"SE-ceef38c4-e099-40cc-9331-7282d6102f6a\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><u><b>\'소규모 봉제공장 설립\'</b></u></span><span id=\"SE-23af15f2-a30f-40a3-8c52-3f1a83d9f9f4\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">과<br /></span><span id=\"SE-26b86b5f-2e01-41d9-b92a-45bb39fd00c8\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>마을 아이</b></span><span id=\"SE-a101d140-3825-4b58-9d7f-ba23a1959a7b\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">들을 위한 </span><span id=\"SE-27eda8c1-8558-4745-9a57-75de183ae2c7\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><u><b>\'도서&amp;놀이키트\'</b></u></span><span id=\"SE-c53c6e5c-762d-46b6-af9d-12a73118807c\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"> 지원에 사용될 예정입니다.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&#x1f53d; 지금바로 참여하기 &#x1f53d;</strong><br /><a href=\"https://www.ohmycompany.com/reward/11197\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>https://www.ohmycompany.com/reward/11197</strong></a></h4>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-c6667528-a8a1-4da0-8ed6-79328b60732d\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">카야가 준비한 양말은 쉽게 접할 수 없는 남다름을 가졌습니다. <br /></span><span id=\"SE-91676a96-7a71-4dd4-a4d2-47ba0946526f\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">허투루 만들지 않은 \'컬러앤컴포트\'의 양말 직접 신어보세요 !!<br /></span>.<br />.</p>\n<p id=\"SE-a532e4c9-6d81-481f-9d29-b90c8a9d174f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-8e14e80b-b455-4f99-8789-7891f04c1a2a\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>[싹~다 있는 남다른 양말]<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-6ab41413-ef7b-47b3-be09-43dc5eaf9693\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;세균, 땀 냄새 제거하는 효성 에어로실버 기능 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-5a733ee6-9b4a-44cb-b432-951a76a29f38\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;30수 코마 면사, 200침 고밀도 쫀쫀짜임 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-a32e861e-9926-4629-8e62-f9d58318bf79\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;직접 개발한 감각적인 디자인 &amp; 감성적인 색감 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-dd583e07-1e84-4db8-a0ac-898a6b59077a\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f; BCI 인증실 사용, ZERO WASTE로 친환경 잇다!<br /></b></span><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f; ‘수익금 전액’ 기부로 사람과 세상을 잇다!</b><span id=\"SE-aa0102b7-784b-4341-b6cb-969265858938\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><b>​</b></span></p>\n<p id=\"SE-070bed32-e488-419c-8cb5-1876415eb78a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-5f7c15ba-8615-4d37-a082-1f13034bb6eb\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;2.5cm의 흘러내림 없는 무압박 발목밴드 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-cf1576fb-7c9a-4d51-af1c-605dfa50d6fd\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;절대 안벗겨지는 4줄 와이파이 논슬립 잇다!</b></span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><br />.<br />.<br />_<br /><a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/savemyanmar/\">#Savemyanmar</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%AF%B8%EC%95%BC%EB%A7%88/\">#미야마</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%B9%88%EB%AF%BC%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%84/\">#빈민마을</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%AF%B8%EC%96%80%EB%A7%88%EC%BF%A0%EB%8D%B0%ED%83%80/\">#미얀마쿠데타</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%BD%94%EB%A1%9C%EB%82%9819/\">#코로나19</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%81%AC%EB%9D%BC%EC%9A%B0%EB%93%9C%ED%8E%80%EB%94%A9/\">#크라우드펀딩</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8E%80%EB%94%A9%EC%98%A4%ED%94%88/\">#펀딩오픈</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8E%80%EB%94%A9%EC%B0%B8%EC%97%AC%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8/\">#펀딩참여이벤트</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%AF%B8%EC%96%80%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%98%EB%B4%84/\">#미얀마의봄</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8C%A8%EC%85%98%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#패션양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%97%AC%EB%A6%84%EB%8D%A7%EC%8B%A0/\">#여름덧신</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%ED%81%AC%EC%82%AD%EC%8A%A4/\">#페이크삭스</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%85%BC%EC%8A%AC%EB%A6%BD%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#논슬립양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%95%88%EB%B2%97%EA%B2%A8%EC%A7%80%EB%8A%94/\">#안벗겨지는</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%95%80%ED%9D%A1%EC%88%98%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#땀흡수양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EA%B8%B0%EB%8A%A5%EC%84%B1%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#기능성양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B9%9C%ED%99%98%EA%B2%BD%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#친환경양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EA%B8%B0%EB%B6%80%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#기부양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%88%98%EC%9D%B5%EA%B8%88%EC%A0%84%EC%95%A1%EA%B8%B0%EB%B6%80/\">#수익금전액기부</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B0%A9%ED%95%9C%EC%86%8C%EB%B9%84/\">#착한소비</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B6%94%EC%84%9D%EC%84%A0%EB%AC%BC%EC%84%B8%ED%8A%B8/\">#추석선물세트</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B6%94%EC%84%9D%EC%84%A0%EB%AC%BC%EC%B6%94%EC%B2%9C/\">#추석선물추천</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90%EC%84%A0%EB%AC%BC/\">#양말선물</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90%EC%84%B8%ED%8A%B8/\">#양말세트</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%84%A0%EB%AC%BC%EC%9A%A9%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#선물용양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%8B%B9%EB%8B%A4%EC%9E%88%EB%8A%94/\">#싹다있는</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%82%AD%EC%8A%A4%EC%9E%87%EB%8B%A4/\">#삭스잇다</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%98%A4%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%B4%EC%BB%B4%ED%8D%BC%EB%8B%88/\">#오마이컴퍼니</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B9%B4%EC%95%BC%EC%9D%B8%ED%84%B0%EB%82%B4%EC%85%94%EB%84%90/\">#카야인터내셔널</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%BB%AC%EB%9F%AC%EC%95%A4%EC%BB%B4%ED%8F%AC%ED%8A%B8/\">#컬러앤컴포트</a></p>\n<div class=\"autosourcing-stub-extra\"> </div>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[hr height=\"20\" style=\"default\" line=\"default\" themecolor=\"0\"]<br /><!-- // --></p>\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->", "미얀마 빈민 여성들과 아이들을 위한 \'토닥토닥\' 추석 양말 선물세트 펀딩 오픈", "", "inherit", "closed", "closed", "", "3821-revision-v1", "", "", "2021-09-08 17:45:16", "2021-09-08 08:45:16", "", "3821", "http://khayah.org/khayah/3821-revision-v1/", "0", "revision", "", "0");
INSERT INTO `khayah_posts` VALUES("3831", "1", "2021-09-08 17:46:42", "2021-09-08 08:46:42", "<p id=\"SE-1e7300f3-f924-4d81-8f2d-51b8789bb5ff\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><br />안녕하세요. 카야 인터내셔널입니다. &#x1f60a;<br /></span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><br />카야의 주요 해외 사업지인 미얀마는<br /></span><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">\'쿠데타\'와 \'코로나19\'로 여전히 힘겨운 시간을 보내고 있습니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">그 속에서도 \'양공 더공세이컨 69약궤\' 빈민마을은<br /></span><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">당장 먹을 것이 없고, 일자리가 사라지며  실업률은 90%까지 치솟았습니다.<br />그야말로 매일매일이 위태롭기만 합니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">카야 인터내셔널은 홀로 생계를 책임지는 빈민마을 여성들과<br />코로나19로 1년 반째 학교 수업을 들을 수 없는 아동들을 위한<br /></span><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">\'토닥토닥\' 추석 양말 선물세트 펀딩을 준비했습니다.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3 id=\"SE-0bcd97c2-be3d-49bc-9ac1-222aed45ec90\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"><span id=\"SE-5d098a24-8340-49bf-b33a-feb06908668c\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">더욱 많은 사람들과 함께 </span><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">더욱 큰 힘으로<br /></span></span><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"></span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\">미얀마 빈민 여성과 아이들을 위한<br /></span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\">\'토닥토닥\' 추석 양말 선물세트로</span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SE-a91b6a22-77b9-44a8-9759-fbac1eee6e03\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x1f389;</b></span><span id=\"SE-8335482b-781f-431a-b8ae-09cd39175fe3\" class=\"se-fs-fs28 se-ff-   \" style=\"color: #4cb327;\"><i><span style=\"color: #80c72d;\"><strong>오마이컴퍼니</strong></span><b><span style=\"color: #80c72d;\"> 펀딩</span> </b></i></span><span id=\"SE-a088eae5-250e-444a-af65-44b96a126a0e\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"><b>을 </b></span><span id=\"SE-0a5ed8c4-776c-4ad9-ba5f-253ad3c1dd24\" class=\"se-fs-fs28 se-ff-   \" style=\"color: #3556b8;\"><i><b>오픈 </b></i></span><span id=\"SE-d6990531-beb7-466d-abc3-f705f28ad961\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><b><span style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\">했습니다.!!</span>&#x1f389;<br /><br /></b></span></h3>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-3823\" src=\"http://khayah.org/khayah/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/001.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>&#x2705; OPEN: 2021년 9월 6일 (월)<br />&#x2705; CLOSE: 201년 9월 30일 (목)</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>다가오는 추석 고마운 맘을 &#x1f381;고급 양말 선물세트&#x1f381;로 전해보세요.<br />주변에 나눌수록 기쁨이 배가 됩니다.&#x2764;&#xfe0f;<br />더 많은 사람이 함께할 수 있도록 많이많이 소문내주세요.&#x1f64c;<br />펀딩 참여 이벤트도 진행 중이니 많은 참여부탁드립니다.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p id=\"SE-f44cc857-dfe8-42a3-95c7-534bbdb653e7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-82c83f33-20b4-497f-ab24-b6d8ca6dfc42\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">리워드의 제작 및 운영비를 제외한 </span><span id=\"SE-b2ace004-96e9-4166-9f4a-335cd2dbf3aa\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2757;&#xfe0f;</b></span><span id=\"SE-6fe52b54-b599-48f2-8104-20e90bd8639b\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">펀딩 수익금 전액</span><span id=\"SE-6df808ce-59b8-45bb-a323-034d36ddcdd5\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2757;&#xfe0f;</b></span><span id=\"SE-1eb0e918-c444-473d-b137-80dc58e6feb9\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">은<br /></span><span id=\"SE-12bb8cf1-facb-4c15-a674-994b73624fef\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>\'카야 미얀마\'를 통해</b></span><span id=\"SE-a63ee2fd-a7a1-47be-b191-ce1532296406\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"> 양곤 더공세이컨 69약궤<br /></span><span id=\"SE-af248873-6132-4006-88b6-abc81e524a6b\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>빈민 여성</b></span><span id=\"SE-50ca5772-3bd0-4b51-b06e-65db21201109\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">들의 안정적인 일자리와 생계를 위한 </span><span id=\"SE-ceef38c4-e099-40cc-9331-7282d6102f6a\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><u><b>\'소규모 봉제공장 설립\'</b></u></span><span id=\"SE-23af15f2-a30f-40a3-8c52-3f1a83d9f9f4\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">과<br /></span><span id=\"SE-26b86b5f-2e01-41d9-b92a-45bb39fd00c8\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>마을 아이</b></span><span id=\"SE-a101d140-3825-4b58-9d7f-ba23a1959a7b\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">들을 위한 </span><span id=\"SE-27eda8c1-8558-4745-9a57-75de183ae2c7\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><u><b>\'도서&amp;놀이키트\'</b></u></span><span id=\"SE-c53c6e5c-762d-46b6-af9d-12a73118807c\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"> 지원에 사용될 예정입니다.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&#x1f53d; 지금바로 펀딩 참여하기 &#x1f53d;</strong><br /><a href=\"https://www.ohmycompany.com/reward/11197\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>https://www.ohmycompany.com/reward/11197</strong></a></h3>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-c6667528-a8a1-4da0-8ed6-79328b60732d\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">카야가 준비한 양말은 쉽게 접할 수 없는 남다름을 가졌습니다. <br /></span><span id=\"SE-91676a96-7a71-4dd4-a4d2-47ba0946526f\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">허투루 만들지 않은 \'컬러앤컴포트\'의 양말 직접 신어보세요 !!<br /></span>.<br />.</p>\n<p id=\"SE-a532e4c9-6d81-481f-9d29-b90c8a9d174f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-8e14e80b-b455-4f99-8789-7891f04c1a2a\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>[싹~다 있는 남다른 양말]<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-6ab41413-ef7b-47b3-be09-43dc5eaf9693\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;세균, 땀 냄새 제거하는 효성 에어로실버 기능 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-5a733ee6-9b4a-44cb-b432-951a76a29f38\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;30수 코마 면사, 200침 고밀도 쫀쫀짜임 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-a32e861e-9926-4629-8e62-f9d58318bf79\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;직접 개발한 감각적인 디자인 &amp; 감성적인 색감 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-dd583e07-1e84-4db8-a0ac-898a6b59077a\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f; BCI 인증실 사용, ZERO WASTE로 친환경 잇다!<br /></b></span><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f; ‘수익금 전액’ 기부로 사람과 세상을 잇다!</b><span id=\"SE-aa0102b7-784b-4341-b6cb-969265858938\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><b>​</b></span></p>\n<p id=\"SE-070bed32-e488-419c-8cb5-1876415eb78a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-5f7c15ba-8615-4d37-a082-1f13034bb6eb\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;2.5cm의 흘러내림 없는 무압박 발목밴드 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-cf1576fb-7c9a-4d51-af1c-605dfa50d6fd\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;절대 안벗겨지는 4줄 와이파이 논슬립 잇다!</b></span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><br />.<br />.<br />_<br /><a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/savemyanmar/\">#Savemyanmar</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%AF%B8%EC%95%BC%EB%A7%88/\">#미야마</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%B9%88%EB%AF%BC%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%84/\">#빈민마을</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%AF%B8%EC%96%80%EB%A7%88%EC%BF%A0%EB%8D%B0%ED%83%80/\">#미얀마쿠데타</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%BD%94%EB%A1%9C%EB%82%9819/\">#코로나19</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%81%AC%EB%9D%BC%EC%9A%B0%EB%93%9C%ED%8E%80%EB%94%A9/\">#크라우드펀딩</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8E%80%EB%94%A9%EC%98%A4%ED%94%88/\">#펀딩오픈</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8E%80%EB%94%A9%EC%B0%B8%EC%97%AC%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8/\">#펀딩참여이벤트</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%AF%B8%EC%96%80%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%98%EB%B4%84/\">#미얀마의봄</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8C%A8%EC%85%98%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#패션양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%97%AC%EB%A6%84%EB%8D%A7%EC%8B%A0/\">#여름덧신</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%ED%81%AC%EC%82%AD%EC%8A%A4/\">#페이크삭스</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%85%BC%EC%8A%AC%EB%A6%BD%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#논슬립양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%95%88%EB%B2%97%EA%B2%A8%EC%A7%80%EB%8A%94/\">#안벗겨지는</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%95%80%ED%9D%A1%EC%88%98%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#땀흡수양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EA%B8%B0%EB%8A%A5%EC%84%B1%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#기능성양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B9%9C%ED%99%98%EA%B2%BD%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#친환경양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EA%B8%B0%EB%B6%80%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#기부양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%88%98%EC%9D%B5%EA%B8%88%EC%A0%84%EC%95%A1%EA%B8%B0%EB%B6%80/\">#수익금전액기부</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B0%A9%ED%95%9C%EC%86%8C%EB%B9%84/\">#착한소비</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B6%94%EC%84%9D%EC%84%A0%EB%AC%BC%EC%84%B8%ED%8A%B8/\">#추석선물세트</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B6%94%EC%84%9D%EC%84%A0%EB%AC%BC%EC%B6%94%EC%B2%9C/\">#추석선물추천</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90%EC%84%A0%EB%AC%BC/\">#양말선물</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90%EC%84%B8%ED%8A%B8/\">#양말세트</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%84%A0%EB%AC%BC%EC%9A%A9%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#선물용양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%8B%B9%EB%8B%A4%EC%9E%88%EB%8A%94/\">#싹다있는</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%82%AD%EC%8A%A4%EC%9E%87%EB%8B%A4/\">#삭스잇다</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%98%A4%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%B4%EC%BB%B4%ED%8D%BC%EB%8B%88/\">#오마이컴퍼니</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%B9%B4%EC%95%BC%EC%9D%B8%ED%84%B0%EB%82%B4%EC%85%94%EB%84%90/\">#카야인터내셔널</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%BB%AC%EB%9F%AC%EC%95%A4%EC%BB%B4%ED%8F%AC%ED%8A%B8/\">#컬러앤컴포트</a></p>\n<div class=\"autosourcing-stub-extra\"> </div>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[hr height=\"20\" style=\"default\" line=\"default\" themecolor=\"0\"]<br /><!-- // --></p>\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->", "미얀마 빈민 여성들과 아이들을 위한 \'토닥토닥\' 추석 양말 선물세트 펀딩 오픈", "", "inherit", "closed", "closed", "", "3821-revision-v1", "", "", "2021-09-08 17:46:42", "2021-09-08 08:46:42", "", "3821", "http://khayah.org/khayah/3821-revision-v1/", "0", "revision", "", "0");
INSERT INTO `khayah_posts` VALUES("3832", "1", "2021-09-08 17:47:11", "2021-09-08 08:47:11", "<p id=\"SE-1e7300f3-f924-4d81-8f2d-51b8789bb5ff\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><br />안녕하세요. 카야 인터내셔널입니다. &#x1f60a;<br /></span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><br />카야의 주요 해외 사업지인 미얀마는<br /></span><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">\'쿠데타\'와 \'코로나19\'로 여전히 힘겨운 시간을 보내고 있습니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">그 속에서도 \'양공 더공세이컨 69약궤\' 빈민마을은<br /></span><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">당장 먹을 것이 없고, 일자리가 사라지며  실업률은 90%까지 치솟았습니다.<br />그야말로 매일매일이 위태롭기만 합니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">카야 인터내셔널은 홀로 생계를 책임지는 빈민마을 여성들과<br />코로나19로 1년 반째 학교 수업을 들을 수 없는 아동들을 위한<br /></span><span id=\"SE-9613b9fb-e831-4742-a7b8-84ce64a741ad\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">\'토닥토닥\' 추석 양말 선물세트 펀딩을 준비했습니다.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3 id=\"SE-0bcd97c2-be3d-49bc-9ac1-222aed45ec90\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"><span id=\"SE-5d098a24-8340-49bf-b33a-feb06908668c\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">더욱 많은 사람들과 함께 </span><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \">더욱 큰 힘으로<br /></span></span><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"></span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\">미얀마 빈민 여성과 아이들을 위한<br /></span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SE-8c0aec94-f3d4-4c34-b3a5-797de5f3e085\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\">\'토닥토닥\' 추석 양말 선물세트로</span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SE-a91b6a22-77b9-44a8-9759-fbac1eee6e03\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x1f389;</b></span><span id=\"SE-8335482b-781f-431a-b8ae-09cd39175fe3\" class=\"se-fs-fs28 se-ff-   \" style=\"color: #4cb327;\"><i><span style=\"color: #80c72d;\"><strong>오마이컴퍼니</strong></span><b><span style=\"color: #80c72d;\"> 펀딩</span> </b></i></span><span id=\"SE-a088eae5-250e-444a-af65-44b96a126a0e\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"><b>을 </b></span><span id=\"SE-0a5ed8c4-776c-4ad9-ba5f-253ad3c1dd24\" class=\"se-fs-fs28 se-ff-   \" style=\"color: #3556b8;\"><i><b>오픈 </b></i></span><span id=\"SE-d6990531-beb7-466d-abc3-f705f28ad961\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><b><span style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\">했습니다.!!</span>&#x1f389;<br /><br /></b></span></h3>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-3823\" src=\"http://khayah.org/khayah/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/001.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>&#x2705; OPEN: 2021년 9월 6일 (월)<br />&#x2705; CLOSE: 201년 9월 30일 (목)</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>다가오는 추석 고마운 맘을 &#x1f381;고급 양말 선물세트&#x1f381;로 전해보세요.<br />주변에 나눌수록 기쁨이 배가 됩니다.&#x2764;&#xfe0f;<br />더 많은 사람이 함께할 수 있도록 많이많이 소문내주세요.&#x1f64c;<br />펀딩 참여 이벤트도 진행 중이니 많은 참여부탁드립니다.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p id=\"SE-f44cc857-dfe8-42a3-95c7-534bbdb653e7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-82c83f33-20b4-497f-ab24-b6d8ca6dfc42\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">리워드의 제작 및 운영비를 제외한 </span><span id=\"SE-b2ace004-96e9-4166-9f4a-335cd2dbf3aa\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2757;&#xfe0f;</b></span><span id=\"SE-6fe52b54-b599-48f2-8104-20e90bd8639b\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">펀딩 수익금 전액</span><span id=\"SE-6df808ce-59b8-45bb-a323-034d36ddcdd5\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2757;&#xfe0f;</b></span><span id=\"SE-1eb0e918-c444-473d-b137-80dc58e6feb9\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">은<br /></span><span id=\"SE-12bb8cf1-facb-4c15-a674-994b73624fef\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>\'카야 미얀마\'를 통해</b></span><span id=\"SE-a63ee2fd-a7a1-47be-b191-ce1532296406\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"> 양곤 더공세이컨 69약궤<br /></span><span id=\"SE-af248873-6132-4006-88b6-abc81e524a6b\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>빈민 여성</b></span><span id=\"SE-50ca5772-3bd0-4b51-b06e-65db21201109\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">들의 안정적인 일자리와 생계를 위한 </span><span id=\"SE-ceef38c4-e099-40cc-9331-7282d6102f6a\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><u><b>\'소규모 봉제공장 설립\'</b></u></span><span id=\"SE-23af15f2-a30f-40a3-8c52-3f1a83d9f9f4\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">과<br /></span><span id=\"SE-26b86b5f-2e01-41d9-b92a-45bb39fd00c8\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>마을 아이</b></span><span id=\"SE-a101d140-3825-4b58-9d7f-ba23a1959a7b\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">들을 위한 </span><span id=\"SE-27eda8c1-8558-4745-9a57-75de183ae2c7\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><u><b>\'도서&amp;놀이키트\'</b></u></span><span id=\"SE-c53c6e5c-762d-46b6-af9d-12a73118807c\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"> 지원에 사용될 예정입니다.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&#x1f53d; 지금바로 펀딩 참여하기 &#x1f53d;</strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.ohmycompany.com/reward/11197\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>https://www.ohmycompany.com/reward/11197</strong></a></h3>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-c6667528-a8a1-4da0-8ed6-79328b60732d\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">카야가 준비한 양말은 쉽게 접할 수 없는 남다름을 가졌습니다. <br /></span><span id=\"SE-91676a96-7a71-4dd4-a4d2-47ba0946526f\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \">허투루 만들지 않은 \'컬러앤컴포트\'의 양말 직접 신어보세요 !!<br /></span>.<br />.</p>\n<p id=\"SE-a532e4c9-6d81-481f-9d29-b90c8a9d174f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-8e14e80b-b455-4f99-8789-7891f04c1a2a\" class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>[싹~다 있는 남다른 양말]<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-6ab41413-ef7b-47b3-be09-43dc5eaf9693\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;세균, 땀 냄새 제거하는 효성 에어로실버 기능 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-5a733ee6-9b4a-44cb-b432-951a76a29f38\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;30수 코마 면사, 200침 고밀도 쫀쫀짜임 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-a32e861e-9926-4629-8e62-f9d58318bf79\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;직접 개발한 감각적인 디자인 &amp; 감성적인 색감 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-dd583e07-1e84-4db8-a0ac-898a6b59077a\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f; BCI 인증실 사용, ZERO WASTE로 친환경 잇다!<br /></b></span><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f; ‘수익금 전액’ 기부로 사람과 세상을 잇다!</b><span id=\"SE-aa0102b7-784b-4341-b6cb-969265858938\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-  se-style-unset \"><b>​</b></span></p>\n<p id=\"SE-070bed32-e488-419c-8cb5-1876415eb78a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><span id=\"SE-5f7c15ba-8615-4d37-a082-1f13034bb6eb\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;2.5cm의 흘러내림 없는 무압박 발목밴드 잇다!<br /></b></span><span id=\"SE-cf1576fb-7c9a-4d51-af1c-605dfa50d6fd\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \"><b>&#x2714;&#xfe0f;절대 안벗겨지는 4줄 와이파이 논슬립 잇다!</b></span></p>\n<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \"><br />.<br />.<br />_<br /><a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/savemyanmar/\">#Savemyanmar</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%AF%B8%EC%95%BC%EB%A7%88/\">#미야마</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%B9%88%EB%AF%BC%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%84/\">#빈민마을</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%AF%B8%EC%96%80%EB%A7%88%EC%BF%A0%EB%8D%B0%ED%83%80/\">#미얀마쿠데타</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%BD%94%EB%A1%9C%EB%82%9819/\">#코로나19</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%81%AC%EB%9D%BC%EC%9A%B0%EB%93%9C%ED%8E%80%EB%94%A9/\">#크라우드펀딩</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8E%80%EB%94%A9%EC%98%A4%ED%94%88/\">#펀딩오픈</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8E%80%EB%94%A9%EC%B0%B8%EC%97%AC%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8/\">#펀딩참여이벤트</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EB%AF%B8%EC%96%80%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%98%EB%B4%84/\">#미얀마의봄</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8C%A8%EC%85%98%EC%96%91%EB%A7%90/\">#패션양말</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%EC%97%AC%EB%A6%84%EB%8D%A7%EC%8B%A0/\">#여름덧신</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%ED%81%AC%EC%82%AD%EC%8A%A4/\">#페이크삭스</a> <a class=\" xil3i\" tabinde